@startuml
title Life Game — 모델과 UI 분리, 그리드 설정, Mediator
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "Swing UI" {
  class Life <<기존>>
  class Clock <<기존>>
  class UniversePanel {
    ~installMenus()
    #paintComponent(graphics : Graphics)
  }
  class CellRenderer
}

package "게임 제어와 보드 구성" {
  class LifeMediator <<Mediator>> {
    +tick()
    +toggle(x : int, y : int)
    +clear()
    +load(input : InputStream)
    +store(output : OutputStream)
    +resize(builder : UniverseBuilder)
  }
  class LifeFacade <<Facade>> {
    +tick()
    +toggle(x : int, y : int)
    +setAlive(x : int, y : int, alive : boolean)
    +isAlive(x : int, y : int) : boolean
    +clear()
    +width() : int
    +generation() : long
    +createSnapshot() : Snapshot
    +restore(snapshot : Snapshot)
    +setRule(rule : LifeRule)
    +addListener(listener : Consumer<Event>)
    +removeListener(listener : Consumer<Event>)
    +visitCells(visitor : CellVisitor)
    +load(input : InputStream)
    +store(output : OutputStream)
  }
  class "LifeFacade.Snapshot" as Snapshot {
    -width : int
    -generation : long
    -state : Storable
  }
  class "LifeFacade.Event" as Event <<record>> {
    change : Change
    generation : long
  }
  enum "LifeFacade.Change" as Change {
    TICK
    EDIT
    CLEAR
    RESTORE
    LOAD
    RULE
    RESIZE
  }
  class UniverseBuilder <<Builder>> {
    +blockSize(size : int) : UniverseBuilder
    +levels(levels : int) : UniverseBuilder
    +cellPixels(pixels : int) : UniverseBuilder
    +rule(rule : LifeRule) : UniverseBuilder
    +width() : int
    +build() : LifeFacade
    ~buildModel(selectedRule : LifeRule) : UniverseModel
  }
}

package "보드 모델" {
  class UniverseModel {
    ~tick()
    ~setRule(rule : LifeRule)
    ~visitCells(visitor : CellVisitor)
    ~createMemento() : Storable
    ~restore(state : Storable, generation : long)
  }
  interface Cell <<기존>>
  class Neighborhood <<기존>>
  class Resident <<기존>>
  interface LifeRule <<Strategy>> {
    +nextState(alive : boolean, neighbors : int) : boolean
  }
  interface CellVisitor <<Visitor>> {
    +enterNeighborhood(x : int, y : int, width : int) : boolean
    +visitResident(x : int, y : int, alive : boolean)
    +leaveNeighborhood(x : int, y : int, width : int, active : boolean)
  }
  class LegacyCellInput {
    {static} ~toggle(board : Cell, here : Point, surface : Rectangle)
  }
}

package "회귀 테스트" {
  class LifeArchitectureTest <<JUnit>>
}

Life ..> UniversePanel : 생성
Life ..> LifeMediator : 생성
Life ..> UniverseBuilder : 기본 보드 구성
Life ..> Clock : 틱 콜백 연결
UniversePanel --> LifeMediator : 입력 전달
UniversePanel --> LifeFacade : 보드 조회 및 이벤트 구독
UniversePanel ..> CellVisitor : 테마로 렌더러 조립\n(E8, e8-theme-renderer.puml 참고)
CellRenderer ..|> CellVisitor

LifeMediator --> LifeFacade : 모델 작업 요청
LifeMediator ..> UniverseBuilder : 크기 검증 및 적용
LifeFacade *-- UniverseModel : 현재 보드 모델
LifeFacade ..> UniverseBuilder : 모델 교체
LifeFacade ..> Snapshot : 생성 및 복원
LifeFacade ..> Event : 변경 알림
Event --> Change : 변경 종류
UniverseBuilder ..> LifeFacade : 생성
UniverseBuilder ..> UniverseModel : 생성
UniverseBuilder --> LifeRule : 초기 규칙

UniverseModel *-- Neighborhood : 루트 블록
UniverseModel --> LifeRule : 현재 규칙
Neighborhood ..|> Cell
Resident ..|> Cell
Neighborhood *-- "1..*" Cell : 하위 셀
Resident --> LifeRule : 다음 상태 계산
Cell ..> CellVisitor : accept()
Cell ..> LegacyCellInput : userClicked() 위임
LifeArchitectureTest ..> LifeFacade : 상태 및 이벤트 검증
LifeArchitectureTest ..> LifeMediator : 보드 교체 검증

note right of LifeMediator
  Clock 정지는 Life에서 주입한
  Runnable 콜백을 호출한다.
end note

@enduml
